fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"Compiler-properties.html#does-a-function-exist","fragment":"Does a function exist?\nJust having a header doesn't say anything about its contents.\nSometimes you need to explicitly check if some function exists. This\nis how we would check whether the function open_memstream exists in\nheader stdio.h\nWhen targeting macOS, the header in the prefix argument is also what makes the check\nrespect the deployment target.  See Platform notes.\n"});